<main class="write-main ux-workflow"><header class="ux-page-heading"><p class="ux-eyebrow">Personal workspace</p><h1>Choose the next useful action.</h1><p>Writing, communication, planning and delivery in one consistent workspace. Status comes from saved records; opening a shortcut does not send or publish anything.</p></header><div class="ux-stat-grid"><?php foreach($counts as$label=>$count):?><section class="ux-card"><p class="ux-metric"><?=$count===null?'—':number_format($count)?></p><h2><?=e($label)?></h2><?php if($count===null):?><p class="ux-muted">Count could not be confirmed.</p><?php endif;?></section><?php endforeach;?></div><div class="ux-journey-grid"><?php foreach(ux_workspace_groups()as$group=>$links):?><section class="ux-card"><h2><?=e($group)?></h2><ul class="ux-action-list"><?php foreach($links as$href=>$label):?><li><a href="<?=url($href)?>"><?=e($label)?> <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></li><?php endforeach;?></ul></section><?php endforeach;?></div><p class="ux-muted">Use Find a workspace, or Ctrl/Cmd + K, to jump to an existing section. Secret credentials are never included in workspace search or form-review previews.</p></main>
